{
  "version": "1.5.0",
  "name": "SY-PPT-templates",
  "description": "20 templates for Markdown-driven PPT generation, 14 designed for Chinese local scenarios. Agent-native: clone the repo, read AGENTS.md, generate a single-file HTML deck. v1.1 adds custom aspect override, image embedding, a Lucide icon system, and an opt-in FX layer on 4 themes.",
